# Shared Transitions — a masonry grid of photos inside an independent native
# stack; tapping a photo fades to a Details screen (header image + text that
# fades in with entering/exiting layout animations).
# What this test covers: open Details from both columns, go back via the header
# back button (tapped right of the overlapping demo Close button) and via the
# iOS edge-swipe, back while the Details text is still fading in (exiting
# interrupts entering), a rapid double tap on a photo, scroll the masonry list
# to the end and open the last photos, scroll back.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/shared-transitions"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 45000
# Warm-up touch on the status bar: the first touch of a test can be lost while
# the XCTest runner attaches.
press 330 20
wait 500
wait "text" "Home" 10000
wait 1000
# Left column, first photo -> Details.
press 100 200
wait "text" "Details" 3000
wait 1200
# Header back button: its left half sits under the demo's Close button.
press 100 84
wait 1000
wait "text" "Home" 3000
# Right column photo -> Details, back with the edge swipe.
press 300 400
wait "text" "Details" 3000
wait 1200
gesture pan 2 450 300 0 400
wait 1000
wait "text" "Home" 3000
# Back while the text is still fading in (FadeIn.delay(400/600)).
press 100 450
wait 250
press 100 84
wait 1000
wait "text" "Home" 3000
# Rapid double tap on one photo, then a single back must return Home.
press 300 600 --count 2
wait 1500
press 100 84
wait 1000
wait "text" "Home" 3000
# Scroll to the end of the masonry list and open a bottom photo.
gesture pan 200 750 0 -550 250
wait 600
gesture pan 200 750 0 -550 250
wait 1500
press 300 700
wait "text" "Details" 3000
wait 1200
press 100 84
wait 1000
# One upward scroll only (a downward drag starting at offset 0 closes the demo).
gesture pan 200 250 0 550 250
wait 1000
wait "text" "Home" 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
